<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Sitara Ch half-yr net dips.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Sitara Ch half-yr net dips.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		  819 vs 609</p>
<p>    Profit before tax   65 vs  76</p>
<p>    Profit after tax    48 vs  56</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Sitara Chemical Industries Ltd. The firm manufactures chemicals. The firm said it carried forward 73 million vs 80 million unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. There is no book closure as the firm has not announced any interim dividend. -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
